__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `qc/` is DENY-BY-DEFAULT, and that is deliberate. Do not relax it.
#
# The working tree carries `qc/calibration_sean.json`, which holds sean's
# (bruniss's) verbatim per-point umbilicus coordinates for PHerc0125/0211/0826
# — 25 real control points per scroll, read out of the three files he posted in
# the Vesuvius Challenge Discord on 2026-08-08. Those are his annotation, not
# ours. This package deliberately does not redistribute them: README section 3
# compares against them and ships only `qc/sean_reference.json`, a digest of
# twelve scalars per file from which no coordinate can be recovered.
#
# The blanket `qc/*` below is the only thing keeping that file unpublished.
# It has held: the path has never appeared in any commit in this repository's
# history, and the blob it would produce does not exist in the object database.
#
# So: add files here ONE BY ONE with an explicit `!qc/<exact-name>` negation
# after reading what is in them. Never add a wildcard negation such as
# `!qc/calibration_*.json` or `!qc/*.json` — either would publish his
# coordinates silently. Never `git add -f` anything under `qc/` without
# checking it first. If `qc/calibration_sean.json` ever needs to be shipped,
# that is sean's call to make, not ours.
#
# `ref_sean/` below is where `scripts/fetch_sean.py` installs his three
# original files once a reader supplies them; it is excluded for the same
# reason and is likewise never to be negated.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
qc/*
!qc/validation_raw.json
!qc/validation_final_raw.json
!qc/stick_control_raw.json
!qc/sean_reference.json
!qc/order_fixture_*.npz
!qc/winding_map_metrics.json
# Added 2026-08-15 for README section 7, each read before being negated:
#   the prior PHerc1218 annotation by Iyan Dopico, MIT-licensed and public
#   since 2026-07-21 (365 z/y/x control points, no metadata block);
#   its provenance note; the section-7 pre-registration; and two files of our
#   own measurements. None of them contains any of sean's coordinates.
!qc/prior_umbilicus_PHerc1218_IyanDopico.json
!qc/prior_umbilicus_PHerc1218_SOURCE.md
!qc/PRIOR1218_PREREGISTRATION.md
!qc/prior_1218_raw.json
!qc/prior_1218_centroid_raw.json
ref_sean/
